{"id":"n49248-1-7","stage":2,"title":"소유 · 所有","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n49248-1-7-1","ko":"이 공터는 누구 소유의 땅인가요?","zh":"这块空地是谁的地呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"공터는","meaning":"空地，闲地","explanation":"공터：空地，闲地；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"공터","audio":"/audio/78d9062079de227d934f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15285","senseId":"1","lemma":"공터","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공터는","audio":"/audio/e96a82d12309c2970f95.mp3"}},{"text":"누구","meaning":"谁","explanation":"누구：谁","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"1","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}},{"text":"소유의","meaning":"所有、拥有（누구 소유：归谁所有）","explanation":"소유 是名词，既可指拥有这件事，也可指所有物；누구 소유의 땅 在这里问土地归谁所有，不是某个具体物品。","readings":[{"term":"소유","audio":"/audio/4daeb6c1358e3b4446ca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49248","senseId":"1","lemma":"소유","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소유의","audio":"/audio/dd3e755ed18f784e4d56.mp3"}},{"text":"땅인가요?","meaning":"地皮，宅基地，土地","explanation":"땅：地皮，宅基地，土地；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ가요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"땅","audio":"/audio/f330041e9e005a6bf8b4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30206","senseId":"4","lemma":"땅","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"땅인가요","audio":"/audio/5c8a158bea114446fc26.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"78d9062079de227d","term":"공터","zh":"空地，闲地","audio":"/audio/78d9062079de227d934f.mp3","entryId":"15285","definition":"没有房子或农田的空土地。","pronunciation":["공터"]},{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"指不认识的人。","pronunciation":["누구"]},{"id":"4daeb6c1358e3b44","term":"소유","zh":"所有、拥有","audio":"/audio/4daeb6c1358e3b4446ca.mp3","entryId":"49248","definition":"所有、拥有","pronunciation":["소ː유"]},{"id":"f330041e9e005a6b","term":"땅","zh":"地皮，宅基地，土地","audio":"/audio/f330041e9e005a6bf8b4.mp3","entryId":"30206","definition":"可建房或种地而生活的地方。","pronunciation":["땅"]}],"audio":"/audio/130d5eabfda546ad0d62.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n49248-1-7-2","ko":"공터 바로 옆에 있는 집 주인의 땅이에요.","zh":"是空地正旁边那栋房子主人的地。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"공터","meaning":"空地，闲地","explanation":"공터：空地，闲地","readings":[{"term":"공터","audio":"/audio/78d9062079de227d934f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15285","senseId":"1","lemma":"공터","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공터","audio":"/audio/78d9062079de227d934f.mp3"}},{"text":"바로","meaning":"就","explanation":"바로：就","readings":[{"term":"바로","audio":"/audio/a441b444c56119c0f154.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64744","senseId":"7","lemma":"바로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바로","audio":"/audio/a441b444c56119c0f154.mp3"}},{"text":"옆에","meaning":"旁，旁边","explanation":"옆：旁，旁边；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"옆","audio":"/audio/c140e1936b454b24fb3a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20243","senseId":"1","lemma":"옆","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옆에","audio":"/audio/f259a3ee3dd4d4a24841.mp3"}},{"text":"있는","meaning":"位于、在（房屋的位置）","explanation":"공터 바로 옆에 있는 집 指位于空地正旁边的房子，있다 在此说明位置。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"8","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있는"